{"unit_id":"FxRayHughes__dsh-peer-link#feature-1","repo":"FxRayHughes/dsh-peer-link","commit":"0cb6905623bf2e87059fb49d6e59cba86e3a84a9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 互联的功能「远端子代理委派」：把任务交给配对设备上的 DSH 会话执行，并将其作为可续接子代理使用；可通过 send_message 继续或引导同一远端会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-14","peer-model.js:3-18","index.js:173-184"]}
